server agent (standalone, just execute. ensure .env contains model, key and url. I was using gpt.4.1

[MultiAgentChat_light.py](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23509655/MultiAgentChat_light.py)

and remote agent. (ensure .env exists), start main.py

[agent.py](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23509665/agent.py)
